---
import Verticalgrid from "../assets/Verticalgrid.astro";
---

<section class="relative">
  <Verticalgrid />
  <div class="relative py-12 mx-auto max-w-7xl lg:py-24">
    <div class="mx-auto lg:text-center">
      <div>
        <p class="text-sm text-transparent uppercase bg-gradient-to-r from-indigo-300 to-indigo-400 bg-clip-text">
          Complete Store Credit Management for eCommerce
        </p>
        <h2 class="mt-8 text-white text-2xl xl:text-3xl 2xl:text-5xl font-normal tracking-tight text-white">
          Intelligent Workflows with Effective Results 
        </h2>
        <p class="font-body text-xl xl:text-2xl mt-4 text-vulcan-300 ">
            Create AI powered workflows for engagement retention and acquisition of users</br> Grow your store and drive revenue with Loyalty Marketing Automation</br>
        </p>
      </div>
      <div
        class="relative items-center w-full pb-0 mx-auto mt-12 overflow-hidden max-w-7xl lg:p-10 lg:pb-0 lg:rounded-5xl bg-vulcan-900 lg:border border-white/10"
        style="">
        <img
          class="object-cover w-full -mb-12 border shadow-2xl rounded-xl border-white/5 lg:rounded-3xl shadow-vulcan-950"
          src="/assets/dashboard.svg"
          alt=""
        />
      </div>
      <ul class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-6 mt-12 lg:text-left sm:grid-cols-3 lg:gap-12"
        role="list">
        <li>
          <div>
            <p class="text-2xl font-medium text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-indigo-300 via-indigo-400 to-indigo-500 lg:text-4xl">
              Automate
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-2 text-base text-vulcan-300">Create custom workflows to deliver data driven and highly complex promotion campaigns. Seamlessly integrate all features like store credit, coupons, gift cards, digital wallet etc into complex workflows to acquire, convert and retain customers.</div>
        </li>
        <li>
          <div>
            <p
              class="text-2xl font-medium text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-indigo-300 via-indigo-400 to-indigo-500 lg:text-4xl">
              Personalization            
          </div>
          <div class="mt-2 text-base text-vulcan-300">
            Create fully automated data drive campaigns that are tailored fit for your customers. Provide personalized incentives for each customer based on their activities and profile in the form of rewards, cashbacks, loyalty points, coupons, gift cards, store credits and more.
          </div>
        </li>
        <li>
          <div>
            <p
              class="text-2xl font-medium text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-indigo-300 via-indigo-400 to-indigo-500 lg:text-4xl">
              Integrations
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-2 text-base text-vulcan-300">
            Integrates seamlessly with all most popular eCommerce platforms and connected apps to provide more personalized workflows. Effortlessly deploy highly impactful experiences at every stage of the customer journey — with just a few clicks.
          </div>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
